[32m+[m[32m# F04: Paid Services Marketplace[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mBranch: `feat/f04-paid-services-marketplace`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Implemented workflow[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCommunity Admins publish community-scoped catalogue entries, including specialization,[m
[32m+[m[32mstarting price, and active/inactive availability. The catalogue starts empty; no[m
[32m+[m[32mproduction-looking sample services are inserted. Residents request a service for[m
[32m+[m[32mtheir backend-derived apartment. The request snapshots the service and location.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mA Community Admin in the request community or a Tower Representative in its tower[m
[32m+[m[32massigns an available, qualified existing Maintenance Worker. There is no provider[m
[32m+[m[32mactor, provider account, or registration flow. Super Admin marketplace access is[m
[32m+[m[32mnot added; existing Super Admin functionality is unchanged.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe assigned worker submits an estimate. Only the requesting resident can approve,[m
[32m+[m[32mreject, or request revisions. An estimate is the total service price, including[m
[32m+[m[32mmaterials. Each revision is retained. Submitting a revision pauses chargeable work;[m
[32m+[m[32mthe latest estimate must be approved before starting, reporting progress, or[m
[32m+[m[32mcompleting work. An approved increase must precede additional chargeable work.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe resident or an authorized Community Admin/Tower Representative schedules a[m
[32m+[m[32mfuture appointment of at most eight hours. Explicit timezones are required by the[m
[32m+[m[32mAPI; the UI converts device-local appointment input to UTC. Overlapping appointments[m
[32m+[m[32mfor either the worker or resident are rejected. Work starts inside its appointment[m
[32m+[m[32mwindow; an expired unstarted appointment must be rescheduled.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mWorkers post progress notes and submit a completion report plus final cost. Final[m
[32m+[m[32mcost cannot exceed the latest resident-approved estimate. An authorized Community[m
[32m+[m[32mAdmin/Tower Representative approves it or requests corrections. Correcting an old[m
[32m+[m[32mbill does not release a worker's newer assignment.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAfter final-cost approval, an authority creates exactly one payment tracking record.[m
[32m+[m[32mThe backend derives its amount from the approved final cost and its payee from the[m
[32m+[m[32massigned worker profile/user. Clients cannot choose the amount or payee. All amounts[m
[32m+[m[32mare integer INR paise. Paid service reviews remain separate from complaint reviews[m
[32m+[m[32mand do not alter existing complaint performance statistics.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Payment tracking, not payment processing[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m`APPROVED -> PAYMENT_REPORTED -> EVIDENCE_VERIFIED -> RECEIPT_CONFIRMED`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Authorization transfers no money. The resident pays the worker outside Urbanity.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The resident uploads a JPEG/PNG/WebP receipt (maximum five images, 5 MB each),[m
[32m+[m[32m  then reports its transaction reference and evidence ID.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Evidence is accessible only through authenticated, request-scoped retrieval.[m
[32m+[m[32m- An authority independently checks the receipt, amount, payee, and reference, then[m
[32m+[m[32m  records manual verification. Rejected evidence returns the payment to `APPROVED`[m
[32m+[m[32m  for correction, retaining the rejection in activity history.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Only the assigned intended worker payee can acknowledge receipt after verification.[m
[32m+[m[32m- There is no gateway, automatic transfer, bank reconciliation, or automatic `PAID`[m
[32m+[m[32m  status. `RECEIPT_CONFIRMED` denotes a worker's manual acknowledgement.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Reporting the same external reference for multiple payment records is rejected.[m
[32m+[m[32m  Duplicate approvals, stale request versions, and unauthorized mutations are rejected.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Transactions are separate from subscription simulation, rent, maintenance dues,[m
[32m+[m[32m  and community expenses.[m
[32m+[m
